      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This powerful magic I've discovered seems to be somewhat of a "
        },
        {
          "text": "double-edged sword",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". It greatly "
        },
        {
          "text": "fortifies me against powerful blows",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", but makes my defense much more "
        },
        {
          "text": "brittle against smaller attacks",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", much like a diamond: extremely hard but will shatter if struck just right. \n\nAll incoming attacks cannot do more than 4 damage (2 hearts) to me, but anything that does less will be increased to 4 damage. This might be a good candidate for shorter durations, and I can see several offensive possibilities to apply this to my target as well...\n\nThis spell part can only be crafted by those who have aligned themselves with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Undead",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
